@startuml
' UC14.5 - Xóa Course
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' Scope: confirmed soft deletion from an already loaded Instructor Course Detail page.
' Authoritative UC/BR: docs/source-of-truth/LearnUP_UseCase.docx (UC14.5) and
' docs/source-of-truth/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx (BR-89/90/340/341/95/96).
' Architecture: docs/source-of-truth/LearnUP_Service_Architecture.docx sections 3.3, 3.4, 6.7.
' No separate Database Guide was found; ownership checked against
' docs/architecture/database-ownership.md, docs/database/LearningService_Database_Design.md
' and the actual Prisma schemas. Specifications do not substitute for executed source.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.detail.tsx:137 (handleSoftDelete), :140 (Modal.confirm),
' :162 (DELETE), :170 (success/navigation), :329 (Draft/Rejected and !locked visibility).
' Entry list: frontend/src/pages/instructor/my.courses.tsx:220 (View Details action).
' The static course.delete.blocked.tsx page is not called by handleSoftDelete.
' Wrapper: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:225 (softDeleteCourseAPI).
' Axios: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47, :61 and :64;
' URL: frontend/src/config/env.ts:13; frontend/.env.development:10 = http://localhost:8080.
' No frontend .env/.env.local/.env.development.local or process URL overrides found.
' Local dev mode: frontend/package.json:7; frontend/vite.config.ts:11 loads env.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:42 (courses route), :45 (predicate).
' Course prefix/version: services/course-service/src/main.ts:41 (api, URI v1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:276.
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:1852 and :1864.
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:1677.
' Retention calculation: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/course-trash.constants.ts:28.
' Hidden Learning adapter: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/clients/learning/learning.client.ts:100.
' HTTP timeout: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.module.ts:16 (5000 ms).
' Direct Learning URL: services/course-service/.env:7 = http://localhost:8085.
' Learning controller: services/learning-service/src/modules/enrollments/enrollments.controller.ts:106;
' service: services/learning-service/src/modules/enrollments/enrollments.service.ts:481;
' repository: services/learning-service/src/modules/enrollments/enrollments.repository.ts:141.
' Learning bootstrap: services/learning-service/src/main.ts:12 -> src/app.setup.ts:30.
' HTTP contracts: contracts/openapi/course-service.yaml:6; contracts/openapi/learning-service.yaml:9.
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:18 (CourseChain), :31 (Course);
' services/learning-service/prisma/schema.prisma:10 (Enrollment).
' Each PrismaService uses its own DATABASE_URL; local course_db and learning_db were verified.
' Error UI: frontend/src/utils/course-trash.ts:45 and :91 handles resolved Axios error bodies.
' Running servers and non-development deployment URLs have not been verified.

actor Instructor
boundary "Course Detail Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
participant ":EnrollmentsController" as EnrollmentsController
participant ":EnrollmentsService" as EnrollmentsService
participant ":EnrollmentsRepository" as EnrollmentsRepository
database "course_db" as CourseDB
database "learning_db" as LearningDB

' Precondition: authenticated Instructor; Course details are already loaded.
' My Courses selects View Details; that separate read operation is not replayed here.
' UI shows Move to Trash only for Draft/Rejected and unlocked Courses.
' Stale/direct requests can still reach backend business rejection outcomes.
' JWT middleware and token refresh are preconditions, not the main deletion flow.
activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Click Move to Trash
activate Screen
Screen -->> Instructor: Show confirmation\n7-day retention; quota remains in use
Instructor -> Screen: Confirm Move to Trash
' Cancel sends no DELETE; this diagram follows the confirmed interaction.
Screen -> Gateway: DELETE /api/v1/courses/{courseId}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Controller: DELETE /api/v1/courses/{courseId}\nTrusted userId, organizationId, role
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: softDelete(user, courseId)
activate Service

' Outcome-level alternative: success expands the actual guards, REST and transaction.
' Failed attempts are summarized below without claiming successful writes or a
' successful downstream HTTP reply after a timeout. This is not an extra future check.
alt Course moved to Trash successfully
  Service -> Service: requireInstructor(user)
  activate Service
  ' Requires role INSTRUCTOR and nonempty organizationId before asking Learning.
  deactivate Service

  ' LearningClient is a forwarding adapter, deliberately omitted as a lifeline.
  ' Direct REST uses internal key and trusted user/organization/role headers.
  ' Actual order: Enrollment history is checked BEFORE Course ownership/status lookup.
  Service -> EnrollmentsController: GET /api/v1/enrollments/internal/courses/{courseId}/history
  activate EnrollmentsController
  EnrollmentsController -> EnrollmentsService: hasEverEnrollment(user, courseId)
  activate EnrollmentsService
  ' Controller requires INSTRUCTOR; service requires organizationId.
  EnrollmentsService -> EnrollmentsRepository: hasEverEnrollment(organizationId, courseId)
  activate EnrollmentsRepository
  EnrollmentsRepository -> LearningDB: Find any Enrollment for this Course version\nCurrent organization; any lifecycle status
  activate LearningDB
  ' enrollment.findFirst selects id only. Completed/Withdrawn and all other statuses count.
  ' This is a Course-version check, not a whole-chain check or an InProgress learner count.
  LearningDB -->> EnrollmentsRepository: No Enrollment found
  deactivate LearningDB
  EnrollmentsRepository -->> EnrollmentsService: false
  deactivate EnrollmentsRepository
  EnrollmentsService -->> EnrollmentsController: hasEverEnrolled = false
  deactivate EnrollmentsService
  EnrollmentsController -->> Service: 200 OK - hasEverEnrolled = false
  deactivate EnrollmentsController

  Service -> Repository: softDeleteCourse(organizationId, instructorId, courseId)
  activate Repository
  Repository -> CourseDB: Begin transaction and lock owned Course\nCheck trash, Draft/Rejected and unlocked
  activate CourseDB
  ' SELECT joins courses to course_chains; filters c.id, c.organization_id,
  ' cc.instructor_id and applies FOR UPDATE OF c. No lock on the chain row is taken here.
  ' Under that lock, read status, lockedAt and deletedAt; reject missing/already trashed,
  ' non-Draft/Rejected, or locked Course. Learning REST is not repeated inside this transaction.
  CourseDB -->> Repository: Eligible Course; row lock held
  Repository -> CourseDB: Set deletedAt and deletedBy\nPreserve status, structure and file references
  ' Only soft-delete fields are explicitly changed; Prisma also maintains updatedAt.
  CourseDB -->> Repository: Soft delete committed
  deactivate CourseDB
  Repository -->> Service: courseId, deletedAt and calculated purgeAt
  deactivate Repository
  ' getPurgeAt adds exactly 7*24 hours; purgeAt is computed, not a persisted Course column.
  Service -->> Controller: Soft-delete result
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK - Course moved to Trash
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: courseId, deletedAt and purgeAt
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Instructor: Show success and open My Courses
else Deletion eligibility failed
  ' Restore the incoming executions closed by the preceding alternative.
  activate Gateway
  activate Controller
  activate Service
  ' Wrong role/missing organization:403 before REST.
  ' History=true:409 COURSE_HAS_ENROLLMENT before any Course repository invocation.
  ' With history=false, transaction rejects wrong owner/tenant/missing/already trashed:404
  ' COURSE_NOT_FOUND; wrong status:409 COURSE_NOT_DELETABLE; locked:409 COURSE_LOCKED.
  ' These failed transaction attempts may read/lock a Course, but do not update deletedAt.
  ' Existing enrollment history can take precedence over a later ownership/404 check.
  Service -->> Controller: Access, Course or Enrollment conflict
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 403 / 404 / 409 with business error
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Deletion error
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Instructor: Show mapped error and keep Course detail
else Enrollment verification failed
  activate Gateway
  activate Controller
  activate Service
  ' Same REST attempt: non-2xx, invalid hasEverEnrolled boolean, transport failure,
  ' or 5000 ms timeout. LearningClient fails closed; no retry and no false fallback.
  ' No successful downstream execution, cancellation or reply after timeout is assumed.
  ' Repository.softDeleteCourse is never called on this path.
  Service -->> Controller: ENROLLMENT_CHECK_UNAVAILABLE
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 503 Service Unavailable
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Enrollment verification error
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Instructor: Show verification error and keep Course detail
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' UI success navigates to /instructor/courses; it does not optimistically remove a row.
' The following My Courses load is UC14, outside this diagram. Its actual findAll
' predicate includes deletedAt:null (courses.service.ts:83); its successful result
' therefore excludes this Course. A later list-load failure is not a failed DELETE.
' On failure the modal onOk catches the error rather than rethrowing it; there is no
' navigation to course.delete.blocked.tsx and no automatic Course/detail reload.
' getCourseApiErrorCode understands error.code in resolved Axios bodies and maps the
' deletion error to a user message; the finally block resets deleting in all cases.
' BR-89/95/96: Draft/Rejected and chain owner/organization are enforced; any retained
' Enrollment row in the current organization/version blocks deletion. Code also rejects Locked.
' Enrollment REST precedes the Course transaction; it is not a cross-database transaction.
' FOR UPDATE OF c serializes changes using that Course row lock; the ownership read
' is through the chain join, not a separate lock on course_chains.
' BR-340: status/rejectionReason remain unchanged; deletedAt marks Trash, deletedBy is stored,
' and purgeAt represents the 7-day recovery deadline. Repeating DELETE is not idempotent
' success: with history=false an already trashed Course maps to COURSE_NOT_FOUND (404).
' BR-90: no CourseChain or MediaFile is deleted/released by this operation. Actual usage
' at internal-courses/internal-courses.service.ts:344 counts chains with any Course,
' including trashed ones, and Ready/unreleased MediaFile bytes, retaining quota/storage.
' Architecture section 6.7 broadly names CourseDeleted under UC14.5. Actual softDeleteCourse
' writes no Outbox or event; CourseDeleted is created in the separate permanent-delete
' transaction (courses.repository.ts:2063), consistent with the UC/BR trash-versus-purge split.
' No audit/notification call or Outbox insert exists in this soft-delete execution.
' Missing named Database Guide limits document cross-checking; service-owned Prisma
' schemas, the Learning database design and the checked REST contracts are the DB evidence.
' UUID validation (400), ordinary auth rejection and unexpected DB/transport failures
' are technical errors omitted from the expanded business alternatives; no write success assumed.
' Restore, permanent deletion, 7-day purge scheduler, storage/quota release, Quiz/Assignment
' deletion and all Assessment/storage/Kafka work are outside UC14.5 and are not drawn.
@enduml
